  "body": "For Sale by Auction- Sunday, 6th DEC at 12PM, On site (Unless Sold Prior)\r\nYes, It's True! A New Chapter Awaits! After more than 14 wonderful years of calling this property home, our owners have decided it's time to embark on their next exciting journey.\r\n\r\nSolidly constructed with BRICK and CEDAR cladding, this beautiful home offers generous living spaces, a peaceful and private setting, and thoughtfully updated interiors with modern finishes and attention to detail.\r\nFeatures You'll Love:\r\n- Freehold title of 601sqm, floor area approx. 203sqm.\r\n- Recently repainted exterior - giving the home a fresh and well-maintained appearance.\r\n- Upstairs: Spacious living with great outdoor flow, beautifully renovated open-plan kitchen, thoughtfully designed for modern family living and effortless entertaining.\r\n- Upstairs: Master bedroom with ensuite, plus one good size bedroom with tastefully renovated separate bathroom\r\n- Downstairs: 2 good size bedrooms with separate bathroom, brand new carpet for you!\r\n- Easy-care flooring - stylish, practical and low-maintenance for busy lifestyles.\r\n- Vacant & Ready for Immediate Possession\r\n- Zoned for Long Bay College, Northcross Intermediate, Torbay School and Sherwood School\r\n\r\nA home that has been cherished for over a decade is now ready to welcome its next proud owners. Every home has a story. Now it's time for you to write the next chapter.\r\n\r\nWe warmly invite you and your family to come and experience everything this special home has to offer. Your next chapter could begin right here! Call/Text me today for private view, otherwise I will see you at open homes. This property must be sold on or prior to the auction day.\r\n\r\nConjunction from ALL Agents welcome from day one.",
